<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 13/14.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 13/14.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 13/14. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    August 13/14   August 12/13</p>
<p>    CZK     0.43574	  0.43584</p>
<p>    DKK     2.1013	   2.10049</p>
<p>    FIM     2.67288	  2.67687</p>
<p>    GBP    23.4322	  23.51058</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07467	  0.07478</p>
<p>    LTL     3.70014	  3.71604</p>
<p>    LVL    25.27948	 25.3751</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00255	  0.00256</p>
<p>    SEK     1.84862	  1.85935</p>
<p>    UAH     8.98468	  8.01769</p>
<p>    USD    14.8024	  14.866</p>
<p>    XEU    15.73717	 15.74161</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
